<title>USA: American General Corp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>American General Corp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			   $0.33		    $0.05</p>
<p> Net			  68,000		    9,000</p>
<p> Revs		    2,810,000		2,658,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  212,600		  211,300</p>
<p>			     YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			   $2.75		    $2.64</p>
<p> Net			 577,000		  545,000</p>
<p> Revs		   10,900,000	     10,360,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  213,600		  208,900</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Oper net, excluding realized investment gains and losses, non-recurring items and one-time accounting changes, was $155 million, or $0.74/shr vs $6 million, or $0.03/shr, for Q4, and $645 million, or $3.07/shr vs $537 million, or $2.60/shr, for year.</p>
